  Archive, ArrowLeft, Bell, BookOpen, CalendarClock, Check, ChevronLeft, ChevronRight, CircleAlert, ClipboardList,
  Download, Eye, FileSpreadsheet, KeyRound, LayoutDashboard, LogOut, Mail, Menu, MessageSquare,
